  "prefLabel": "Gal 501.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-10-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 501.02 Scope. These rules shall be binding upon:\n\n(a) Every person who holds board certification of any type as a guardian ad litem in the state of New Hampshire; and\n\n(b) In accordance with RSA 490-C:4, I (e), formerly certified guardians ad litem alleged to have engaged in acts or omissions prohibited when certified.\n\nSource. #8941, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15\n\nNew. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16\n\nNew. #12010, eff 10-21-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gal500.html"
